/corpus_owner/
/gallery/
/tooling/out/

# Personal photo corpora used by the instrumented tests. These are the owner's own
# photographs (papers, tables, book spreads) and are NOT published. Only the manifests
# (*.json: sizes, split labels, oracle corner coordinates) are tracked; the tooling that
# rebuilds them is under tooling/ (see app/src/androidTest/assets/README.md).
/app/src/androidTest/assets/owner110/*.jpg
/app/src/androidTest/assets/holdout*/*.jpg
/app/src/androidTest/assets/corpus/
/app/src/androidTest/assets/bookspread/*.jpg
/app/src/androidTest/assets/bookspread_real/*.jpg
/app/src/androidTest/assets/live_room/*.jpg
/app/src/androidTest/assets/pencil/*.jpg

# Generated evidence pages embed crops of the owner's own photographs, so they are built
# locally and not published. Regenerate with tooling/h40_ink_report.py — see
# docs/evidence/README.md. The measured summaries (*.md / *.json) ARE tracked.
/docs/evidence/h39-ink/img/
/docs/evidence/h39-ink/index.html

